        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBN2003/12, 12\" Contemporary Nobe Bathroom Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern feel of this Deltana BBN2003/12 towel bar makes it great for any contemporary setting. It is small enough for cramped bathrooms and the 12 inch length means that it will not overwhelming in the kitchen for hand towels. It is available in polished chrome and satin nickel finishes. This Nobe series towel bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBN2003_12-specifications.gif?v=1704354677\" width=\"548\" height=\"238\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBN2003/12 12\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-18-inch-nobe-series-towel-bar-deltana-bbn2002-18\"><b>18\" Nobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-24-inch-nobe-series-towel-bar-deltana-bbn2003-24\"><b>24\" Nobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-30-inch-nobe-series-towel-bar-deltana-bbn2004-30\"><b>30\" Nobe Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana BBN Nobe Series\"><b>Deltana Nobe Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the BBN Nobe Solid Brass 12 Inch Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BBN2003_12.pdf?v=1691095271\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana BBN2003/12 12\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
